WEBVTT

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.350
The Crown Prince will be killed during the ritual

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.330
We need to finish him off during the ritual.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.330
We haven’t seen each other for two years, and you’re already sending me away?

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.250
Protect the Emperor!

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:24.860
Mu!

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.900
Where is the crown prince?!

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.950
I don't care what she says

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:33.600
Let her go

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.400
I don't want to

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.600
He interfered and ruined everything

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.880
This night we were supposed to celebrate your appointment as crown prince.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.300
We skillfully cleaned up after ourselves

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.670
Think again

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.800
You must remember everything

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.700
One man was wearing furs

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.100
He told others to kill everyone

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.000
Is that you?

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.200
You wanted to kill the crown prince

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.250
Sick idiot, don't try to blame me

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.430
Did your mother tell you?

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.300
I found the killers' hideout

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.200
Who exactly are you?

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.900
You lived for the Empress,

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.120
so die for her

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.010
Episode 4

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:26.200
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:36.300
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:46.400
Beta Editor: Sana

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.630
Who's here?

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.430
I, mother

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:56.500
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:49.340
How dare you...

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.710
Why are you here?

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:19.080
Do you know what I did for you?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.150
So that no one can harm you,

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.940
I erased all traces

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.990
What are you talking about?

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.990
I don't understand

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:34.910
I burned everything

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:38.080
Nothing will lead to you anymore

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.930
Did you really kill everyone?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.240
They lived only for you

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.610
It's okay that they died for you too

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.070
Did you expect me to praise you?

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:02.460
I thought I'd ask if you were hurt?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.800
You're like an animal

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.690
Get out!

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.860
I can't sleep because of the smell of blood

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.060
- I did it for you, mother...
- Mother, mother, mother!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.000
When I hear this word from your lips -
goosebumps run through the body

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.360
I don't want to see you, go away

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.570
Get out now!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.190
I've always been curious

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.930
Why doesn't mom feel sorry for me?

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.730
If you were my mother, you would ask
Am I hurt?

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.320
"Why doesn't my mother ever think about me?"

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.950
I've been waiting so desperately for this

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.310
- Never...
- You are not my son

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:59.360
You are the son of the Kang family of Shinju

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.640
It's all because of the face, right?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.500
You gave me instead of your older brother

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.390
And you keep turning your back on me

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.610
All because of this face!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.240
Do you know how I lived in the Kang family?

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:13.740
One day they left me in the biggest wolf den in Shinzhu

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.930
I fought with them all night
listening to the gnashing of their teeth

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:22.960
Then I set the place on fire

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:28.680
The fire killed them all

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.210
And I survived

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:41.690
I smelled burning flesh

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.200
Crazy Concubine Kan...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:06:00.740
didn't let me pass, I thought
that I am her dead son

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:06.510
When she came to her senses,
then she beat me and locked me up

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.230
She asked where her son was,

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.960
and why is this ugly monster here?

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:21.860
Three days, four days

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:26.190
I was exhausted from thirst
but no one came to check on me

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:29.650
- So what?
- So what...

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.650
A mother recognizes only the son who allows her to shine

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.520
And you are my shame, disgrace and lack

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.270
That's why I sent you

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:57.400
Thanks to you, I felt feelings of love and justice

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.380
Thanks for this

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.420
You will remember today

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.690
Mother, you abandoned me

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.350
I'm just not leaving

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.450
From now on

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.380
you will only look at me

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.180
Nonsense!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.000
If you do something like that again,
and you won’t set foot in Songak again!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.660
Insolent

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.800
- Enough! Enough!
- Just disappear!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.770
Enough, enough! Stop!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.290
Go away!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.370
B-blood?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.850
Yes it's blood

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.640
The blood of those I killed today

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.310
Are mothers building this for their children?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:11.230
She should not have come to this nonsense, but to me, to beg me!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.590
Let me go! Let me go!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:19.830
It's time to stop

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.670
Do you want to die too? Let go!

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:24.180
You are injured!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.950
Are there other wounds?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.400
I told you I killed people

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.170
So tell me why you did this?

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.560
Is this for... fun?

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.270
Leave

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:07.060
Go

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.000
This is such a place, right?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:19.020
Here you must learn to wield a sword from a young age.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:24.070
Must kill others if you want to live

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.590
What can you do about it?

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.890
Wanting to live is not a crime

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.090
You probably won't be forgiven

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.790
But still... I understand you

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.990
It must be you now

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.440
very unhappy

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.310
I think I understand you

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:41.530
On the night of the ritual, we pursued the killers, but found no clues.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:45.070
The person who hired them
killed them to keep them quiet

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.340
We found their refuge in the temple,

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.210
there was a fire, everyone was burned

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.390
However

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:55.350
owner of the temple...

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:03.280
Its owner... Empress Yu

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.720
So I'm behind all this?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.880
Did I try to kill the crown prince?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:20.020
Anyone would think so

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:22.710
Empress

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:27.340
Is it possible that you were planning an assassination attempt on the Crown Prince?

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.890
And they collected the killers?

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.580
I didn't do this

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.250
Your Majesty!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.640
It's all my fault

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.360
I never knew what kind of temple this was,

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.910
so instead of my mother I did
donations there

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.980
Take my life, Your Majesty!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.140
It's all my fault

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.050
If the child stumbles, the mother also stumbles

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.420
I did it

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:59.320
Killed people and set fire to the temple

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:01.930
It was me

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:08.100
You say you wanted to kill
crown prince?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.760
Your Majesty, the murderers lived in a temple that belonged to the empress

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:17.270
During the ritual, they played the role of princes, after which they killed their own

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.300
Obviously that's what they wanted
create discord in our family

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:29.220
Like Uk said, I was afraid
that mother will be blamed for everything

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.510
Sorry for my wrong decision

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.900
You haven't worn it yet, go

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.280
Your turn

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.820
- I don't want to!
- Go yourself

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.450
- Go away!
- No, I don’t want to!

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.260
Chae Ryung

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.330
- Madam
- What's the matter?

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:50.430
We have guests, be careful

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:54.450
No one wants to take food to the 4th prince

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.840
How dare you rush like that
food for the prince?

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:00.000
Stop it

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.380
Someone alone will take him food

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.330
So that I don't see anything like this again

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.390
Me?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.250
Look at them

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.870
I'm a young lady!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:27.090
I don't have to deliver food

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:27.790
Yes, sister?

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:47.280
No, why doesn't he eat in his room?

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.330
Why bother people like that?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.080
I knew I didn't like him

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:53.390
Now even stronger

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:54.820
Damn, I'm tired

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.180
Fathers

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:03.480
Yesterday I made such a commotion

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.810
Looks so innocent from the back

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.550
And lonely

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.850
Your food has arrived

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.800
Leave and go

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.920
Prefer to eat alone in silence?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.270
Eat

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.870
I have to pick up the empty plates

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.380
Eat faster

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:16.420
About yesterday... you didn't see anything

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:19.330
Keep your mouth shut

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:22.570
If I could, I wouldn't say

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:24.750
I can't believe it, even though I saw it

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.140
I have enough of my own problems

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.760
No time to talk about other people

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.990
Constantly ask you to forget everything you saw

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.640
By the way, do you like eating here?

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:46.270
Do you look at the palace from here?

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.930
It's your home anyway

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:53.260
Why would you look at him while eating?

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.790
If this is home, my family must be there.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.990
I heard your father
mother and brothers live there

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.680
By the way, ah... while we're talking,

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.970
why did you do this yesterday?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.000
You! How did you end up in the palace
bathhouse that day?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.660
A... I... Well...

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:25.550
Chae Ryung said the chicken was good

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.890
The doctor hasn't come yet?

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.940
Be strong, sister, okay?

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.290
Su, come out for a while

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.590
What?

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.980
What is it, wife?

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:46.830
What's happened?

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.100
Go

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.760
Get married a second time

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:11.370
wife

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.760
I'm very weak

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.020
And the hostess is useless,
and I can’t give you a child

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:26.150
I haven't done anything for you, prince

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:27.440
Therefore...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.810
Prince,

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:35.280
marry another girl

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:42.420
Or divorce me first

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.030
I must free you from your wrong self

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:51.690
Then I can leave in peace

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.080
I don't want

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.220
You should

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.960
Besides, I know

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.140
You, prince...

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.000
You don't love me

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.720
Stop it!

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.300
What are you so concerned about?

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:10.390
Whatever the concerns -
everyone will leave when you start playing

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.020
Here's a present

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.220
I didn't know you'd like it

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:23.390
So I brought everything that caught my attention

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:25.630
Top

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.840
Ttakzhi

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.780
I really like this thing

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:34.880
The slingshot that never misses

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.720
Take her too

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.630
I've never seen anything like this, right?

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.720
This is a silk ball from the Qing Dynasty

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.430
They say girls like it this way

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:51.060
How old are you that you keep playing with toys?!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.550
Then what do you like?

00:21:56.550 --> 00:22:00.570
I'm already so upset

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:03.420
Take it all, go play somewhere else, okay?

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:08.820
You need to share your burden with others,
to make it easier

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:11.890
Is this something I can help with?

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:15.730
I'm a prince

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.040
Are you married?

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:27.980
Not yet

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:29.950
How many wives will you have?

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:34.330
I didn't even think about it...

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:40.160
Then if your wife gets sick,
will you bring another woman into the house?

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:41.350
No way!

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:44.450
I don't want to have the headache of having too many wives like my father did.

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:49.080
I want to find the perfect wife to live with for 100 years

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:54.580
It would be nice if everyone thought the same way

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:57.760
You're surprisingly pure

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:08.690
She's moving pretty fast

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:10.970
A little fast for me

00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:18.150
Take this to the 4th prince's room,
so that no one finds out

00:23:18.150 --> 00:23:21.550
Don't put it in an obvious place
hide it somewhere

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:32.440
I don't want to!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:36.780
If I run into the prince, I'll die on the spot!

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:38.580
This thing belonged to him

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:39.960
He won't say anything if he sees you

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:49.800
- Clean up the prince's chambers while he's gone
- I obey

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:52.960
What are you doing here?

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:59.640
- You...
- No!

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:01.990
I didn't steal anything!

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:22.700
Tell me, what else did you steal?

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:27.370
I... didn't steal anything

00:24:27.370 --> 00:24:31.290
So, you wanted to give the prince a gift?

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:35.030
Beat

00:24:38.950 --> 00:24:40.180
Stop!

00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:50.230
What did she do wrong, why are you beating her?

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:52.840
She stole something important from the 4th prince

00:24:55.250 --> 00:24:56.980
Is it really a hairpin?

00:24:56.980 --> 00:25:00.050
It was I who asked her to take it to her, she didn’t steal anything!

00:25:00.050 --> 00:25:02.340
This is not something that could belong to you

00:25:02.340 --> 00:25:03.660
It doesn't make sense

00:25:03.660 --> 00:25:05.500
Because she belongs to the prince

00:25:05.500 --> 00:25:07.360
That's why I say it was stolen

00:25:07.360 --> 00:25:08.880
Carry on

00:25:14.410 --> 00:25:17.270
Then hit me

00:25:18.880 --> 00:25:22.020
I can't tell you everything, but Chae Ryung is innocent

00:25:22.020 --> 00:25:25.230
The one you should whip is me

00:25:25.230 --> 00:25:26.430
Madam!

00:25:28.400 --> 00:25:30.290
- Bind
- I obey

00:25:35.530 --> 00:25:36.750
Madam!

00:25:37.950 --> 00:25:39.080
Madam!

00:25:40.180 --> 00:25:41.910
Brother, stop her!

00:25:41.910 --> 00:25:43.570
They're going to beat her up now!

00:25:43.570 --> 00:25:44.830
Why stop?

00:25:44.830 --> 00:25:46.970
Servants need to be taught lessons

00:25:46.970 --> 00:25:50.330
I think the maid has already had enough

00:25:51.390 --> 00:25:54.010
Yong Hwa can whip very hard

00:25:54.910 --> 00:25:56.340
Yong Hwa...

00:26:02.260 --> 00:26:03.630
Yong Hwa!

00:26:09.420 --> 00:26:10.720
Let go

00:26:10.720 --> 00:26:12.130
Enough is enough

00:26:12.130 --> 00:26:14.350
I am in charge of the household

00:26:14.350 --> 00:26:15.560
Let go

00:26:19.720 --> 00:26:21.210
She's mine

00:26:32.170 --> 00:26:35.100
What did you just say?

00:26:38.110 --> 00:26:41.850
This girl belongs to me

00:26:53.770 --> 00:26:56.280
This hairpin is mine too

00:26:56.280 --> 00:27:00.410
I should be the one to decide
what to do with it

00:27:00.410 --> 00:27:01.810
Brother!

00:27:01.810 --> 00:27:03.370
Su didn't steal anything!

00:27:03.940 --> 00:27:06.380
She said she picked it up outside So's room

00:27:07.340 --> 00:27:11.310
No... I saw her pick it up

00:27:12.280 --> 00:27:14.710
- Eun, even you...
- Untie the lady

00:27:15.810 --> 00:27:16.950
Now!

00:27:54.130 --> 00:27:57.230
You were in a hurry this time, Yong Hwa

00:28:04.250 --> 00:28:06.710
Yong Hwa, you're doing the right thing.

00:28:07.540 --> 00:28:09.650
People like this need to be put in their place.

00:28:10.710 --> 00:28:12.000
The atmosphere is terrible

00:28:12.690 --> 00:28:14.190
I guess I'll go

00:28:14.190 --> 00:28:15.560
Me too

00:28:18.440 --> 00:28:19.500
Let's go brother

00:28:19.500 --> 00:28:21.660
Her wounds need ointment

00:28:21.660 --> 00:28:23.840
- Su!
- Send it already!

00:28:23.840 --> 00:28:27.280
Let me go, I say, let me go!

00:28:44.650 --> 00:28:46.410
Do you feel so sorry for her?

00:28:50.400 --> 00:28:54.060
The brother I knew
wouldn't stop me like that

00:28:56.570 --> 00:29:01.000
Do you happen to have feelings for this girl?

00:29:03.770 --> 00:29:05.110
Yong Hwa

00:29:06.110 --> 00:29:08.760
I'm sorry if I humiliated you

00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:43.670
You said she's yours

00:29:47.490 --> 00:29:50.130
I came to say that you seem to have made a mistake

00:29:51.350 --> 00:29:55.230
Nothing here belongs to you

00:29:58.630 --> 00:30:01.530
Neither Yong Hwa nor Hae Soo

00:30:02.410 --> 00:30:03.640
They are mine

00:30:06.590 --> 00:30:10.860
From now on, not with my sister,
nor with my wife's cousin

00:30:12.570 --> 00:30:14.410
don't act careless

00:30:39.330 --> 00:30:40.470
Su

00:30:46.280 --> 00:30:49.610
If you suddenly wake up, take some medicine

00:30:50.390 --> 00:30:51.830
Don't forget to use it

00:31:02.110 --> 00:31:03.240
And one more thing...

00:31:05.920 --> 00:31:09.460
I hope you forget everything
what happened today

00:32:19.420 --> 00:32:20.730
Sorry

00:32:22.920 --> 00:32:24.960
I was embarrassed to see you

00:32:26.090 --> 00:32:27.310
I pretended to be asleep

00:32:32.530 --> 00:32:33.730
I know

00:32:37.240 --> 00:32:41.070
Still very painful?

00:32:42.910 --> 00:32:44.650
Not because I was whipped

00:32:47.210 --> 00:32:49.540
I'm very upset by this treatment

00:32:52.140 --> 00:32:53.690
Here...

00:32:55.640 --> 00:32:57.810
Is it always like this here?

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:02.860
Is this a place where you get pushed around unless you're someone's son or daughter?

00:33:05.470 --> 00:33:11.410
Can a person tie up another person like an animal and beat him?

00:33:14.730 --> 00:33:15.950
Koryo...

00:33:18.290 --> 00:33:20.330
what is it like?

00:33:33.190 --> 00:33:35.120
I'm sorry I couldn't stop it

00:33:37.160 --> 00:33:41.600
However, I promise you

00:33:43.420 --> 00:33:48.040
No one will dare treat you like this again.

00:33:50.910 --> 00:33:52.070
Trust me

00:33:55.910 --> 00:33:57.700
And here we go again

00:33:57.700 --> 00:33:59.470
I think about his wife

00:33:59.470 --> 00:34:04.100
If I let him get closer, I'll hurt his wife.

00:34:40.310 --> 00:34:41.880
You crashed into me

00:34:43.570 --> 00:34:45.250
Do I belong to you?

00:34:45.250 --> 00:34:47.660
Why did they say such a thing and create a misunderstanding?

00:34:47.660 --> 00:34:49.780
Don't know how to say "thank you"?

00:34:49.780 --> 00:34:51.930
I saved you from being whipped

00:34:52.440 --> 00:34:56.310
Before performing,
I would thank you for saving me

00:34:56.310 --> 00:34:58.410
You always acted like this
as if they were going to kill

00:34:58.410 --> 00:35:01.240
I wonder why the wind changed?

00:35:03.580 --> 00:35:04.720
Thank you

00:35:10.120 --> 00:35:12.270
How did you end up with that hairpin?

00:35:12.270 --> 00:35:13.480
When did you take it?

00:35:13.480 --> 00:35:16.040
You dropped it in the palace bath

00:35:16.040 --> 00:35:18.810
It's because I hid something
that I saw your face...

00:35:19.520 --> 00:35:21.540
So I didn't see him

00:35:21.540 --> 00:35:23.340
I keep my promises

00:35:26.300 --> 00:35:28.110
Aren't you afraid of me?

00:35:28.110 --> 00:35:30.770
You keep talking to me

00:35:31.960 --> 00:35:35.000
You don't look like someone to be taken lightly

00:35:35.150 --> 00:35:37.040
But I'm not afraid of you anymore

00:35:39.030 --> 00:35:43.390
However... say no more
that I "belong" to you

00:35:44.630 --> 00:35:45.640
Why?

00:35:45.640 --> 00:35:46.400
I'm a man

00:35:46.400 --> 00:35:47.910
Not a thing or an animal

00:35:47.910 --> 00:35:49.860
How can I belong to you,
or anyone else?

00:35:54.020 --> 00:35:55.390
Then...

00:36:00.750 --> 00:36:03.000
Should I call you "my man"?

00:36:05.400 --> 00:36:07.680
That's not it either

00:36:07.680 --> 00:36:10.710
Let's get rid of this
onerous title

00:36:11.510 --> 00:36:13.030
Come up with something different

00:36:45.890 --> 00:36:49.610
Look, isn't this the 14th prince?

00:36:55.630 --> 00:36:57.340
Let me go!

00:36:57.960 --> 00:36:59.530
Let me go!

00:36:59.810 --> 00:37:03.000
I said let me go!

00:37:03.570 --> 00:37:04.650
Oh no

00:37:04.650 --> 00:37:06.310
Isn't this the 14th prince?

00:37:06.310 --> 00:37:07.620
He's the one!

00:37:08.170 --> 00:37:09.280
Hey you!..

00:37:11.060 --> 00:37:13.150
Go and call someone

00:37:13.150 --> 00:37:14.360
What about you?

00:37:14.360 --> 00:37:15.540
The two of us are not enough

00:37:15.540 --> 00:37:17.820
I need to follow them
and you bring help

00:37:17.820 --> 00:37:19.900
Hurry up, hurry up! Go already!

00:37:32.500 --> 00:37:34.900
Let me go! Let go!

00:37:38.530 --> 00:37:40.250
You don't know who you're dealing with

00:37:40.250 --> 00:37:42.700
Don't you care about your lives?

00:37:42.700 --> 00:37:46.630
Prince Jeong, you are the one who made my hands like this

00:37:46.630 --> 00:37:49.040
- You've gone too far
- I have never done anything like this!

00:37:49.040 --> 00:37:50.120
This is true

00:37:50.120 --> 00:37:52.360
You just lost to me in battle

00:37:52.660 --> 00:37:55.710
And your mother did this to me

00:37:55.710 --> 00:37:58.560
I didn't know anything about this

00:37:58.560 --> 00:37:59.590
Thus...

00:38:08.080 --> 00:38:10.540
Let me go! I told you to let me go!

00:38:10.540 --> 00:38:12.350
Is anyone here?

00:38:13.820 --> 00:38:15.050
No...

00:38:17.730 --> 00:38:18.850
Okay

00:38:19.780 --> 00:38:22.330
Accept it! Forward!

00:38:22.330 --> 00:38:24.820
Hey!

00:38:24.820 --> 00:38:27.320
Fuck off! Get out, you idiots!

00:38:27.320 --> 00:38:30.560
Fuck off! Go away!

00:38:31.930 --> 00:38:35.100
I'll gut your guts and make a stew out of them!

00:38:35.100 --> 00:38:38.360
What are you staring at? If you come closer, you're screwed!

00:38:39.110 --> 00:38:41.780
You are dead if you get close! And stop staring, you idiots!

00:38:42.090 --> 00:38:46.830
Get the fuck away from us, you bastards!!!

00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:53.240
My sister-in-law looks more and more sick every time we meet

00:38:54.070 --> 00:38:56.880
She offered Wook a divorce

00:38:57.390 --> 00:38:59.750
- We should be grateful
- What?

00:39:00.560 --> 00:39:01.840
This is true?

00:39:02.970 --> 00:39:05.100
I won't turn my back on my wife

00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:08.970
I want you to pretend you didn't hear this

00:39:08.970 --> 00:39:12.650
Brother, you should get married again to take care of your future.

00:39:14.300 --> 00:39:17.580
Are you proposing to get married too?
for political reasons,

00:39:17.580 --> 00:39:18.730
what did our third brother do?

00:39:18.730 --> 00:39:19.920
I will lose the emperor's favor

00:39:19.920 --> 00:39:22.230
There are so many ways to avoid suspicion

00:39:22.230 --> 00:39:23.260
Yong Hwa!

00:39:25.990 --> 00:39:29.910
Thanks to the bride's family, we were able to return to the lands of Songak

00:39:29.910 --> 00:39:33.870
I think the only thing right is
don't forget to repay the debt

00:39:34.900 --> 00:39:36.720
- She's sick
- Mom!

00:39:36.720 --> 00:39:38.900
Prince Uk! Prince Uk!

00:39:38.900 --> 00:39:40.940
- Prince!..
- You!

00:39:42.620 --> 00:39:45.870
Prince, something happened to Mrs. Su.

00:39:46.350 --> 00:39:48.900
Come with me!

00:39:54.640 --> 00:39:55.930
Are you okay?

00:39:55.930 --> 00:39:57.710
Sorry you got caught up in this.

00:39:57.710 --> 00:39:59.930
First of all... let's run

00:39:59.930 --> 00:40:01.110
Run? What?

00:40:01.110 --> 00:40:02.700
Let's escape

00:40:02.700 --> 00:40:04.090
I can't do this

00:40:04.090 --> 00:40:05.270
I'm going...

00:40:05.270 --> 00:40:07.180
Are you crazy? Let's run away quickly...

00:40:07.870 --> 00:40:10.310
Prince! God!

00:40:13.240 --> 00:40:15.140
What to do?

00:40:17.060 --> 00:40:18.540
Prince!

00:40:21.740 --> 00:40:23.450
Don't worry

00:40:23.450 --> 00:40:24.970
I'll save you

00:40:24.970 --> 00:40:27.020
So who is saving whom?

00:40:28.160 --> 00:40:29.530
Stop!

00:40:36.160 --> 00:40:37.570
Brother

00:40:49.220 --> 00:40:50.400
Brother

00:40:51.600 --> 00:40:52.980
Are you injured?

00:40:52.980 --> 00:40:54.490
I can stand it

00:40:55.930 --> 00:40:56.960
Are you?

00:40:59.070 --> 00:41:00.280
Catch him!

00:41:39.740 --> 00:41:42.700
Excessive confidence usually leads to trouble. Haven't you heard this statement?

00:41:53.310 --> 00:41:54.750
It's true

00:41:57.750 --> 00:41:59.530
Wolf... Wolf

00:41:59.530 --> 00:42:01.370
Overconfidence usually leads to disaster.

00:42:01.370 --> 00:42:02.280
This is the Wolf

00:42:02.280 --> 00:42:04.220
What should we do? This is the Wolf

00:42:05.070 --> 00:42:06.930
Should we run away?

00:42:08.620 --> 00:42:11.130
You don't run away after you see me?

00:42:12.680 --> 00:42:14.660
Are you all brave people here?

00:42:14.660 --> 00:42:15.880
Or

00:42:19.710 --> 00:42:21.880
do you all want to die?

00:42:23.910 --> 00:42:25.160
Let's run

00:42:55.410 --> 00:42:56.450
Are you injured?

00:42:57.790 --> 00:42:58.890
No

00:42:59.820 --> 00:43:01.550
What a blessing that So came

00:43:05.090 --> 00:43:07.270
I won't forget what you did for me brother

00:43:07.730 --> 00:43:11.720
Ah, you saved my hand, I will remember that

00:43:11.720 --> 00:43:14.650
Now your life is my life

00:43:14.650 --> 00:43:17.070
Even if I have to die
I will save your life

00:43:17.570 --> 00:43:20.420
Oh my god... Oh my god!

00:43:20.420 --> 00:43:22.670
Our youngest prince

00:43:22.670 --> 00:43:26.230
You are already so reliable and strong!
You will soon become a great man!

00:43:29.540 --> 00:43:30.640
Oh-oh

00:43:31.370 --> 00:43:32.710
I'm sorry

00:43:34.830 --> 00:43:37.830
You reminded me of my little brother

00:43:37.830 --> 00:43:39.750
It's okay

00:43:39.750 --> 00:43:42.190
Hae Soo's sister?

00:43:43.490 --> 00:43:44.650
Sister?

00:43:47.510 --> 00:43:50.510
Please watch what kind of man I become

00:43:51.580 --> 00:43:52.820
Of course

00:43:52.820 --> 00:43:54.950
Prince Jeong, fightin'!

00:43:56.830 --> 00:43:59.550
Fa... Fi...

00:43:59.550 --> 00:44:00.580
tin

00:44:01.610 --> 00:44:03.440
Fightin!

00:44:04.180 --> 00:44:05.370
Fightin!

00:44:08.190 --> 00:44:09.650
Fightin!

00:44:12.150 --> 00:44:13.420
Wait for me

00:44:15.360 --> 00:44:18.760
Slow down a little

00:44:22.340 --> 00:44:23.800
Are you angry?

00:44:24.910 --> 00:44:25.970
Why?

00:44:32.360 --> 00:44:34.870
Oh my god

00:44:37.160 --> 00:44:39.840
My leg hurts so much that I can't walk

00:44:44.980 --> 00:44:49.400
I was running away from those men

00:44:49.400 --> 00:44:51.700
I didn't even notice that my leg hurt so much

00:44:53.300 --> 00:44:55.020
And how long ago did I get hurt?

00:44:55.320 --> 00:44:57.080
I don't think I can take a single step

00:45:06.640 --> 00:45:08.400
I thought I lost you

00:45:10.100 --> 00:45:11.170
What?

00:45:13.170 --> 00:45:17.650
I thought I wouldn't be able to see you again

00:45:21.100 --> 00:45:22.930
I was scared

00:45:43.820 --> 00:45:47.350
- Mrs. Su
- Prince Uk!

00:45:47.350 --> 00:45:48.710
Here

00:45:48.710 --> 00:45:50.040
Mistress

00:45:55.130 --> 00:45:57.880
Madam, are you okay?

00:45:57.880 --> 00:45:59.470
What about the 14th prince?

00:45:59.470 --> 00:46:00.890
He's okay too

00:46:01.500 --> 00:46:02.630
Su!

00:46:03.270 --> 00:46:06.670
Sister, I made you worry, I'm sorry

00:46:09.650 --> 00:46:11.820
We sent men

00:46:11.820 --> 00:46:14.140
You and the prince were not there, we were worried

00:46:14.140 --> 00:46:16.680
Mother was very worried

00:46:16.680 --> 00:46:18.400
Tomorrow go to the palace...

00:46:21.540 --> 00:46:22.880
Brother

00:46:46.790 --> 00:46:48.730
You didn't even bother to disguise yourself?

00:46:49.900 --> 00:46:52.010
I came in case my mother finds out

00:46:52.010 --> 00:46:55.510
Thank you for your attention and discretion

00:46:57.090 --> 00:47:00.990
You shouldn't go out alone
if you know such people

00:47:00.990 --> 00:47:04.510
It was bad luck

00:47:04.510 --> 00:47:05.780
Bad luck?

00:47:06.710 --> 00:47:09.600
Because of you, a man was left without an arm and his family was destroyed.

00:47:09.600 --> 00:47:10.950
Bad luck you say?

00:47:13.390 --> 00:47:14.600
How will you fix this?

00:47:14.600 --> 00:47:16.360
I'm telling you, I didn't know!

00:47:16.360 --> 00:47:17.710
I didn't do this!

00:47:19.550 --> 00:47:22.520
And what, ignorance exempts you from responsibility?

00:47:23.300 --> 00:47:24.610
You are a prince

00:47:24.610 --> 00:47:27.490
Don't you know that the higher your status, the more responsibility you have?

00:47:27.490 --> 00:47:29.100
funny

00:47:29.100 --> 00:47:32.040
Since when did you start acting like this?
like a real brother?

00:47:34.360 --> 00:47:37.410
Oh, you decided to pretend because your mother is cold only with you?

00:47:37.410 --> 00:47:41.230
Want to put your little brother down to show off?

00:47:41.890 --> 00:47:44.100
Yo is right about you

00:47:45.240 --> 00:47:50.920
Coming out of the same womb as you is so embarrassing

00:47:53.320 --> 00:47:54.710
Stupid child

00:47:54.710 --> 00:47:56.180
- Brother
- You!

00:47:56.880 --> 00:47:59.410
- Move away
- Mom!

00:48:02.080 --> 00:48:03.960
Don't go near him!

00:48:03.960 --> 00:48:05.700
Jeong, you will be in danger

00:48:05.700 --> 00:48:08.830
Mom, it was my brother who saved me

00:48:08.830 --> 00:48:11.480
- If it weren't for him, I would have lost my hand.
- Don't be stupid

00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:15.480
He brings misfortune to everyone who is near him

00:48:16.690 --> 00:48:18.250
I went through this too

00:48:18.250 --> 00:48:19.920
You might get hurt too

00:48:19.920 --> 00:48:21.730
Don't go near him

00:48:21.730 --> 00:48:24.370
And yet, it was my brother who saved me

00:48:24.820 --> 00:48:26.160
I want you to say it

00:48:27.000 --> 00:48:29.890
Tell me you won't hang around with Jeong! Speak!

00:48:32.170 --> 00:48:35.210
If that's what you want, of course

00:48:38.370 --> 00:48:40.750
How long are you going to live under her protection?

00:48:43.590 --> 00:48:46.090
Jeong, let me see! Where did you get hurt?

00:48:46.090 --> 00:48:49.040
Jeong, Jeong

00:48:51.030 --> 00:48:52.680
What are these traces?

00:48:53.930 --> 00:48:55.320
Jeong

00:48:55.320 --> 00:48:58.750
My heart breaks when you hurt

00:49:00.310 --> 00:49:03.510
What are you doing? Call the doctor! Alive!

00:50:48.730 --> 00:50:50.570
- Move away!
- Mother!

00:50:51.040 --> 00:50:52.690
Don't go near him!

00:50:52.690 --> 00:50:54.430
Jeong, you will be in danger

00:51:07.180 --> 00:51:09.970
Do you want the 4th prince to live in Songak?

00:51:14.410 --> 00:51:16.670
Do you want to repay him for saving you?

00:51:18.250 --> 00:51:21.960
I want to keep him by my side as one of my people

00:51:23.320 --> 00:51:24.580
Emperor

00:51:24.580 --> 00:51:27.490
I saw the star of the 4th prince light up over Songak

00:51:27.490 --> 00:51:29.380
There must be a reason for this

00:51:29.380 --> 00:51:32.340
The star of the 4th prince entered the constellation of the Crown Prince's Ursa Major...

00:51:32.340 --> 00:51:34.560
Your mother tried to kill the crown prince

00:51:37.270 --> 00:51:40.690
Your elder brother wants to take the place of crown prince

00:51:42.890 --> 00:51:46.930
I never shared their goals

00:51:49.360 --> 00:51:54.540
Then what do you do about the fact that you are the first person to be placed in foster care?

00:51:56.210 --> 00:52:00.520
We sent you as a consolation for Concubine Kang who lost her son

00:52:04.090 --> 00:52:05.460
Not a single day

00:52:06.960 --> 00:52:09.680
I was not her son. More like a hostage

00:52:13.480 --> 00:52:15.770
Don't you know about this, Emperor?

00:52:23.980 --> 00:52:26.170
What if you become crown prince?

00:52:27.380 --> 00:52:31.600
Will you be Yoo from Jeonju or Kang from Shinju?

00:52:40.700 --> 00:52:43.190
I will live as yours and the Crown Prince's loyal subject

00:52:43.190 --> 00:52:47.830
I will not be a brother or a son, but a loyal subject

00:52:54.590 --> 00:52:55.660
Chi Mon

00:52:56.660 --> 00:52:57.920
Yes, Emperor

00:52:58.550 --> 00:53:01.720
Did you say that the 4th prince's star shone over Songak?

00:53:02.480 --> 00:53:06.020
The stars of the emperor and the crown prince are in perfect harmony

00:53:06.020 --> 00:53:10.300
If the 4th Prince stays in Songak, it will be a sign of good luck for Goryeo

00:53:14.760 --> 00:53:18.600
Report the news to the Kang family in Shinju and everyone in Songak.

00:53:19.620 --> 00:53:24.890
From this day forward, the 4th Prince, Wang So, will live in Songak

00:53:28.220 --> 00:53:31.160
Thank you Your Majesty

00:53:31.160 --> 00:53:33.400
Thank you for your favor, Emperor

00:53:51.290 --> 00:53:53.950
Have you lost your appetite?

00:53:56.530 --> 00:54:00.080
Don't worry about me. You need to eat

00:54:05.880 --> 00:54:08.960
You eat less and less. I'm worried

00:54:13.200 --> 00:54:15.390
Sister, this is Su

00:54:26.010 --> 00:54:27.360
Come on in

00:54:27.360 --> 00:54:29.580
I invited you to have dinner with us

00:54:31.110 --> 00:54:33.850
I can eat in the room too

00:54:33.850 --> 00:54:37.340
You sit in your room all day
didn't really eat anything

00:54:38.480 --> 00:54:40.940
I thought it would be better
if we eat together

00:54:40.940 --> 00:54:42.050
Have a seat

00:54:53.530 --> 00:54:57.440
I know you wanted to save the 14th prince, but it was dangerous to go alone

00:54:58.440 --> 00:55:01.270
You didn't know what could have happened if our prince hadn't come

00:55:01.750 --> 00:55:02.800
Yes

00:55:04.690 --> 00:55:06.880
Thank you for saving me

00:55:08.250 --> 00:55:10.030
I did what I had to do

00:55:14.570 --> 00:55:17.200
You're always in trouble
when you're wandering somewhere

00:55:18.180 --> 00:55:20.090
No interest in household chores

00:55:23.170 --> 00:55:28.290
How about sewing or knitting?
It's good to make it from cotton

00:55:29.270 --> 00:55:31.980
I will find something that interests me

00:55:36.290 --> 00:55:37.940
I'll leave first

00:55:38.970 --> 00:55:41.090
I want to read some books

00:56:05.130 --> 00:56:06.660
Are you destroying it again?!

00:56:09.550 --> 00:56:12.010
I don't destroy, I build

00:56:17.330 --> 00:56:18.850
Amazing

00:56:18.850 --> 00:56:20.790
What did you wish for?

00:56:22.720 --> 00:56:24.910
Now do you want to know what people want?

00:56:29.230 --> 00:56:32.000
I'm leaving this house

00:56:34.590 --> 00:56:36.420
I will live in a palace

00:56:37.720 --> 00:56:39.730
We won't collide often anymore

00:56:44.460 --> 00:56:47.860
Lord, I won't have to anymore
deliver food to you?

00:56:47.860 --> 00:56:49.110
Amazing!

00:56:50.230 --> 00:56:52.630
You haven't done this very often
don't be arrogant

00:56:52.630 --> 00:56:56.690
Please live in peace in the palace

00:56:59.150 --> 00:57:02.550
Don't threaten or kill people

00:57:02.550 --> 00:57:06.260
Don't glare at them
if they don't listen to you

00:57:06.260 --> 00:57:10.070
Be careful
don't draw your sword in vain

00:57:11.480 --> 00:57:14.150
Don't destroy what someone is working on
worked hard

00:57:14.150 --> 00:57:16.280
- What else is there?
- Enough!

00:57:16.280 --> 00:57:17.590
Eat well

00:57:19.490 --> 00:57:21.160
Sleep tight

00:57:22.240 --> 00:57:26.150
Try not to have bad dreams

00:57:36.630 --> 00:57:37.780
What?

00:57:39.350 --> 00:57:41.060
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:57:47.740 --> 00:57:49.970
I remembered how you said you weren't afraid of me

00:57:53.280 --> 00:57:54.920
How is this possible?

00:57:56.350 --> 00:57:59.300
I'm most afraid of myself

00:57:59.300 --> 00:58:00.860
Not you, Your Highness

00:58:02.880 --> 00:58:08.080
I can't even control my feelings

00:58:10.200 --> 00:58:12.680
No matter how hard I try to change my direction...

00:58:14.910 --> 00:58:16.070
it doesn't work

00:58:24.790 --> 00:58:27.360
They don't worry about such things

00:58:33.240 --> 00:58:36.340
There are a lot of stars here in Koryo

00:58:38.120 --> 00:58:39.960
What do you mean?

00:58:41.040 --> 00:58:44.180
Don't you believe that you can only see stars in Goryeo?

00:58:46.740 --> 00:58:48.820
Chi Mon would be very surprised

00:58:56.370 --> 00:58:57.620
It's snowing

00:59:06.580 --> 00:59:07.950
Beauty

00:59:15.510 --> 00:59:25.910
I only remember your smell and your laughter

00:59:25.910 --> 00:59:32.360
I'm always waiting only for you, counting the days

00:59:32.360 --> 00:59:37.560
And it doesn’t matter where I am now, because only you are in my thoughts

00:59:38.160 --> 00:59:43.760
What I dreamed about and what I wanted

00:59:43.970 --> 00:59:48.150
I'm only waiting for you

00:59:48.580 --> 00:59:54.450
And every day I can shout “I love you,” so what?

00:59:54.450 --> 01:00:00.120
And every day I can call you

00:59:55.990 --> 01:00:02.500
Thanks for watching with us!
